// Accept twin of reject/E-CAPS-ANCHOR/*: a disjunction is kind-anchored
// when EVERY disjunct bottoms out in a master form [CR#603.2], and the
// disjuncts' caps MEET still supplies the event object ([CR#603.2c] — both
// sides are `ZoneChange`s). (The former twin here refined an anchor with
// `Not`; `Not` is bridge-capped — E-BRIDGE-CAP — until
// engine-one-evaluator, and that twin returns with it.)
Normal(
  name: "Accept Anchored Disjuncts",
  types: [Enchantment],
  abilities: [
    Triggered(
      event: OneOf([
        Enters(Creature),
        ZoneChange(what: Type(Creature), from: Battlefield, to: Graveyard),
      ]),
      effect: Move(EventObject, Exile),
    ),
  ],
)
